              10                     !     ******************************************************************
              11                     !     *                                                                *
              12                     !     *           subroutine for precipitation processes               *
              13                     !     *           from suspended cloud water/ice                       *
              14                     !     *                                                                *
              15                     !     ******************************************************************
              16                     !     *                                                                *
              17                     !     *  originally created by  q. zhao                jan. 1995       *
              18                     !     *                         -------                                *
              19                     !     *  modified and rewritten by shrinivas moorthi   oct. 1998       *
              20                     !     *                            -----------------                   *
              21                     !     *  and                       hua-lu pan                          *
              22                     !     *                            ----------                          *
              23                     !     *                                                                *
              24                     !     *  references:                                                   *
              25                     !     *                                                                *
              26                     !     *  zhao and carr (1997), monthly weather review (august)         *
              27                     !     *  sundqvist et al., (1989) monthly weather review. (august)     *
              28                     !     *  chuang 2013, modify sr to define frozen precipitation fraction*
              29                     !     ******************************************************************
              30                     !
              31                     !     in this code vertical indexing runs from surface to top of the
              32                     !     model
              33                     !
              34                     !     argument list:
              35                     !     --------------
              36                     !       im         : inner dimension over which calculation is made
              37                     !       ix         : maximum inner dimension
              38                     !       km         : number of vertical levels
              39                     !       dt         : time step in seconds
              40                     !       del(km)    : pressure layer thickness (bottom to top)
              41                     !       prsl(km)   : pressure values for model layers (bottom to top)
              42                     !       ps(im)     : surface pressure (centibars)
              43                     !       q(ix,km)   : specific humidity (updated in the code)
              44                     !       cwm(ix,km) : condensate mixing ratio (updated in the code)
              45                     !       qr(ix,km) : condensate rain mixing ratio (updated in the code)
              46                     !       qs(ix,km) : condensate snow mixing ratio (updated in the code)
              47                     !       t(ix,km)   : temperature       (updated in the code)
              48                     !       rn(im)     : precipitation over one time-step dt (m/dt)
              49                     !old      sr(im)     : index (=-1 snow, =0 rain/snow, =1 rain)
              50                     !new    sr(im)     : "snow ratio", ratio of snow to total precipitation
              51                     !       cll(ix,km) : cloud cover
              52                     !hchuang rn(im) unit in m per time step
              53                     !        precipitation rate conversion 1 mm/s = 1 kg/m2/s
              54                     !
